{"args":{"command":"create-entity","data":{"body":"## Acceptance\n\nProperty tests, on both providers through the real kernel authority:\n\n- no transaction whose operations reference an absent node, edge, assertion or evidence commits;\n  the refusal is named and nothing is published;\n- every canonical reference kind (`Subject::Edge`, `Assertion.evidence`, `CanonicalRef<Evidence>`)\n  is typed so a transient identity cannot inhabit it, held by compile-fail cases (AGENTS.md\n  invariant 2); today only node references are typed;\n- replay from the seed reproduces the head root for generated lineages.\n\nThen a `verification-report` maps each P1 exit clause in `docs/roadmap.md` to the case that\nexecutes it.\n","status":"draft","title":"P1 exit properties: no dangling reference commits; the membrane holds for every reference"},"entity_type":"aep.story/v1","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/p1-exit-properties"},"changed":{"body":"## Acceptance\n\nProperty tests, on both providers through the real kernel authority:\n\n- no transaction whose operations reference an absent node, edge, assertion or evidence commits;\n  the refusal is named and nothing is published;\n- every canonical reference kind (`Subject::Edge`, `Assertion.evidence`, `CanonicalRef<Evidence>`)\n  is typed so a transient identity cannot inhabit it, held by compile-fail cases (AGENTS.md\n  invariant 2); today only node references are typed;\n- replay from the seed reproduces the head root for generated lineages.\n\nThen a `verification-report` maps each P1 exit clause in `docs/roadmap.md` to the case that\nexecutes it.\n","title":"P1 exit properties: no dangling reference commits; the membrane holds for every reference"},"entity":"story","entry_hash":"baead0eef31371777a1f1330cdf6b18682797e7dd4a8ca438e4b757ba69b6d09","from_state":null,"id":"p1-exit-properties","parent_hash":"109e67b79a38db23b928308ea1a1c86ebfe70b3ff33478650179c34335d9c453","payload":{"actor":"agent:claude-579ad7f9-p1-14","at":1790151263